.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_01-768x736.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_01.jpg 960w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"48456\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/69_yoko-ono_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"960,920\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yoko Ono in Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_01-960x920.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/69_yoko-ono_02/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTg2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE4NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"186\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02-200x186.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yoko Ono in Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02-200x186.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02-580x540.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02.jpg 610w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"48457\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/69_yoko-ono_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"610,568\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yoko Ono in Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_02.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/69_yoko-ono_03/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"194\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_03-200x194.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yoko Ono in Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_03-200x194.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_03.jpg 506w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"48458\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/69_yoko-ono_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"506,492\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yoko Ono in Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_yoko-ono_03.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p><a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a> suffered worse injuries in the crash than Lennon, and was pregnant at the time. Keen to keep a close eye on her wellbeing, he arranged for Harrods to deliver a double bed to the studio, and had a microphone suspended above it for her to add her thoughts during the sessions that followed.</p><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/5/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">5</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/6/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">6</span></a></div>",
